# Build-context exclusions for os/Containerfile.
#
# os/rootfs/ mirrors the image tree one-to-one (PRD 6.2), which means anything
# left in it ships inside the operating system. These two patterns are repo
# bookkeeping — directory documentation and placeholders that keep empty
# directories in git — and must never reach a user's disk.
rootfs/**/README.md
rootfs/**/.gitkeep
